**Step 1: Add Firebase to your Android project**

* Go to the Firebase console and create a new project.
* Follow the instructions to add Firebase to your Android project: https://firebase.google.com/docs/android/setup
* Add the Firebase Android SDK to your project by adding the following dependencies to your `build.gradle` file:
```groovy
dependencies {
    implementation 'com.google.firebase:firebase-auth:21.0.1'
    implementation 'com.google.firebase:firebase-ui-auth:7.1.1'
}
```
**Step 2: Enable Email/Password authentication in Firebase**

* Go to the Firebase console and navigate to the Authentication section.
* Click on the "Sign-in method" tab and enable the "Email/Password" provider.
* Make sure to enable the "Email Link" option if you want to allow users to sign in with email links.

